sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Viewer
    participant Worker
    User->>Viewer: Open document
    Viewer-->>User: Display text immediately
    loop Visible diagrams
        Viewer->>Worker: Request render
        alt Valid diagram
            Worker-->>Viewer: Rendered image
        else Invalid syntax
            Worker-->>Viewer: Error and original source
        end
    end
    Note over Viewer,Worker: Keep scrolling responsive
